{"id": "t179-002", "text": "Simone turns 40 on December 12th. She's been going on about a proper espresso machine for months, so that might be the gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 40", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "going on about a proper espresso machine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t179-003", "text": "Lars is completely obsessed with Warhammer at the moment. He's painting a whole Space Marine army and showed me photos of the tiny brushes he uses.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Warhammer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Space Marine army", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t179-004", "text": "Talked to Tunde after the meeting. He was made redundant on Friday along with half his team. He's putting a brave face on it but he's clearly rattled. I should check in with him sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the meeting"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "rattled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t179-011", "text": "Oscar's band has a gig at The Lexington on 11/21. I said I'd go, and I'm bringing Emil along too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at The Lexington", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/21", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t179-012", "text": "Spoke to Siddharth on the phone. His mum is having a hip replacement at the end of the month and he's going to stay with his parents for a couple of weeks afterwards to help out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t179-013", "text": "Shreya has got really into crochet. She's making a blanket for her niece, who is due to be born in early February, and wants to try amigurumi next. She showed me a little octopus she made from a YouTube tutorial. Her favourite yarn shop is closing down at the end of the month, so a gift card for somewhere else might be a good birthday idea.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crochet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to try amigurumi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gift card for somewhere else might be a good birthday idea", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t179-018", "text": "Graham told me all about his allotment while we waited for the bus. He's growing six kinds of chilli this year and is very proud of his Carolina Reapers, which he says nobody in the family will touch. He's entering the village show in late August and wants to win the produce category for once, after coming second three years running.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "allotment", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chilli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud of his Carolina Reapers", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "village show", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in late August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to win the produce category", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t179-019", "text": "Agnieszka's mum is turning 70 on June 3rd and the whole family is flying to Kraków for the party. Agnieszka is organising most of it and sounds exhausted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning 70", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t179-027", "text": "Laila has started learning the cello at 35. She practises every morning before work and has her first recital in early March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning before work"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first recital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t179-029", "text": "Rhys is a massive Cardiff City fan. Ask him how the match went at the weekend; he was too nervous to talk about it beforehand.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Cardiff City", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how the match went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "match", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t179-030", "text": "Emil and his girlfriend Valentina are expecting a baby in April. They only found out last month and are telling family over Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting a baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t179-040", "text": "Bao's engagement party was supposed to be this Saturday, but they've called it off because his fiancée's grandad is unwell. They're hoping to rearrange for sometime in the new year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Saturday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "unwell", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year"}]}
{"id": "t179-044", "text": "Varun is into bouldering now. He goes three times a week and has started doing outdoor trips to the Peak District.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "outdoor trips to the Peak District", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t179-046", "text": "Obi's nickname at work is Obs, apparently. Obi Adeyemi, the new guy on the finance team, supports Arsenal and plays five-a-side on Wednesdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obs", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi Adeyemi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the finance team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}]}
{"id": "t179-047", "text": "Agnieszka knits jumpers for her whole family every Christmas. This year she's starting early because she wants to do matching ones for the dogs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knits jumpers", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Christmas"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "This year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dogs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t179-054", "text": "Ciara and Rhys broke up sometime over the summer. She's moved into a flat in Leith by herself and says she's honestly happier, though she admitted the evenings are hard. She's thinking of joining a book club or a climbing group to meet people. Remind me to invite her to the pub quiz on Thursday and to send her the details of Laila's book club.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat in Leith by herself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "happier", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "evenings are hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of joining a book club or a climbing group", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her to the pub quiz", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the details of Laila's book club", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t179-056", "text": "Chris got a puppy! A border collie called Juno. She arrived on the weekend and has already chewed his trainers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "border collie called Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
